sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PUI as PlayerSheetUI
  participant API as CompendiumRouter
  participant QUERY as ContentQueryApplicationService
  participant LRES as LinkedEntryResolutionService
  participant SHEET as CharacterSheetStore
  participant WS as ContentStream
  participant GMUI as ContentManagerUI
  participant APP as CompendiumApplicationService
  participant REV as CatalogRevisionRepository
  participant EVT as ContentEventsMapper

  Note over PUI,EVT: Precondition: actor A references spells [magic_missile, shield], actions [arcane_burst], store revision=720

  PUI->>SHEET: openCharacterSheet(actorA)
  SHEET->>API: POST /api/content/resolve-character-sheet-refs req-5401
  API->>QUERY: resolve_sheet_references(req-5401)
  QUERY->>LRES: resolve_reference_set(actorA refs)
  LRES-->>QUERY: resolved [spell.magic_missile_v1, spell.shield_v2, action.arcane_burst_v1]
  QUERY-->>API: resolved payload + catalog_revision=720
  API-->>SHEET: 200 OK
  SHEET-->>PUI: render sheet references

  GMUI->>API: PUT /api/spells/spell.shield_v2 req-5402 (buff text update)
  API->>APP: update_definition(req-5402)
  APP->>REV: create_revision(reason=mutation, req-5402)
  REV-->>APP: catalog_revision=721
  APP->>EVT: to_definition_updated_event(req-5402, spell.shield_v2, rev721)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_updated(event)
  APP-->>API: resolved
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK

  WS-->>SHEET: definition_updated(spell.shield_v2, rev721)
  SHEET->>SHEET: detect_revision_gap(local=720, incoming=721)
  SHEET->>SHEET: invalidate scope=actorA.reference_resolution
  SHEET-->>PUI: show updating state for affected references

  SHEET->>API: POST /api/content/resolve-character-sheet-refs req-5403 (targeted refetch)
  API->>QUERY: resolve_sheet_references(req-5403)
  QUERY->>LRES: resolve_reference_set(actorA refs at rev721)
  LRES-->>QUERY: resolved [spell.magic_missile_v1, spell.shield_v2(updated), action.arcane_burst_v1]
  QUERY-->>API: resolved payload + catalog_revision=721
  API-->>SHEET: 200 OK
  SHEET-->>PUI: refresh shield entry without full sheet reset

  GMUI->>API: POST /api/spells/spell.shield_v3/supersede req-5404 payload(replaces=spell.shield_v2)
  API->>APP: supersede_definition(req-5404)
  APP->>REV: create_revision(reason=supersede, req-5404)
  REV-->>APP: catalog_revision=722
  APP->>EVT: to_definition_published_event(req-5404, replacement_target=shield_v3, rev722)
  EVT-->>WS: definition_published(event)

  WS-->>SHEET: definition_published(shield_v3 replaces shield_v2, rev722)
  SHEET->>SHEET: follow_replacement_chain(shield_v2->shield_v3)
  SHEET->>API: POST /api/content/resolve-character-sheet-refs req-5405
  API->>QUERY: resolve_sheet_references(req-5405)
  QUERY-->>API: references resolved with shield_v3 at rev722
  API-->>SHEET: 200 OK
  SHEET-->>PUI: render shield as latest replacement

  Note over PUI,EVT: Postcondition: character sheet references remain consistent across updates and replacements